    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>此插件可以实现本地附加上传至云盘123网盘。（This is a plugin that save the attachments to yunpan123.）</p>\n<h3>External Services</h3>\n<p>This plugin connects to the 123Pan API (<code>https://open-api.123pan.com/</code>) to store and retrieve media files.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data sent: API authentication credentials, file metadata, file uploads.</li>\n<li>Data received: URLs for stored files.</li>\n<li>Privacy Policy: <a href=\"https://www.123pan.com/UserPrivacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://www.123pan.com/UserPrivacy</a></li>\n</ul>\n"
